uot;On&quot; &quot;Superposition&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9830-reshyshira","name":"ReshyShira","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9830_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T16:13:13-08:00","id":823836,"title":"","content":"I wonder if the God Machine/Angels refer to the Abyss (such as they might) as the Great NullRef?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T16:24:11-08:00","id":823849,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198357-tetragrammatica-4-004-names-for-the-machine?p=823836#post823836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if the God Machine/Angels refer to the Abyss (such as they might) as the Great NullRef?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was always thinking that the God-Machine was trying to patch the holes in reality that Mages caused, it appeared seemingly out of nowhere one day after all. Who says it couldn't have appeared when the Axis Mundi collapsed? It might see the Abyss as a glitch in reality, a glitch that it has to patch by any means.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9830-reshyshira","name":"ReshyShira","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9830_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T08:00:28-08:00","id":828222,"title":"","content":"The Order<br /> The Hierarchy<br /> The Light<br /> Harmony<br /> Preservation<br /> The Clockwork<br /> The Universal Mind<br /> The Akashic Record<br /> Pangu<br /> Momentum<br /> Father of Lies","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T10:08:29-08:00","id":828283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ManusDomine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198357-tetragrammatica-4-004-names-for-the-machine?p=828222#post828222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Father of Lies</div> </div> </div> </div>Compiler of Deception?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T13:30:20-08:00","id":828394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/198357-tetragrammatica-4-004-names-for-the-machine?p=823766#post823766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I wonder, would the GM use binary or something else? I mean, it possesses the capability to warp the way mathematics and numbers work. Who's to say that it hasn't created a new Base that operates under mathematical laws that do not apply outside its mechanisms?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was reading the bit in <i>Dance Macabre</i> about the Holy Engineers, recently, and the God Machine apparently communicates with them using a numerical code that utilizes a variable base that follows the Fibonacci sequence. So... unary (tally marks, I guess), unary, binary, ternary, quinary, octal, tridecimal, unvegesimal, tetratrigesimal, pentapentagesimal, nonaoctogesimal, and so on. I would presume that it starts over at some point, but assuming that each number isn't huge, continuing to increase the base would stop being noticeable at some point.<br /> <br /> That being said, in this case I think the God Machine may have been deliberately creating a puzzle to be solved, and it seems unlikely that it uses a shifting base like that for its own operations.<br /> <br /> And just so I'm not entirely off topic, here are a few ideas:<br /> <br /> The Old Firm<br /> Robby (could be used to refer to the God Machine and his forces individually or collectively, like the World War II slang term &quot;Jerry&quot;)<br /> The Great Toaster<br /> Old Gearhead Himself<br /> General Motors","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3209,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","user":"CatDoom","date":". 02-11-2016, 04:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T13:44:29-08:00","id":828414,"title":"","content":"The Universal Operating System","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0",